        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "696f4419-8ab9-550c-a083-22cba6f202cf",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: C. J. Hunter\n- Products: Nandrolone, nandrolone decanoate, nandrolone phenylpropionate\n- Events: 2000 US Olympic Trials\n- Concepts: anabolic–androgenic steroids\n\nFacts:\n- C. J. Hunter threw his personal best of 71 feet 9 inches (21.87 meters) during a second-place finish at the 2000 US Olympic Trials.\n- Nandrolone is an injected anabolic–androgenic steroid used medically.\n- Nandrolone is used medically in ester forms including nandrolone decanoate, sold under the brand name Deca-Durabolin, and nandrolone phenylpropionate, sold under the brand name Durabolin.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
